var e=`IsiNgisi`,t=`Isiphi isizinda sedatha ongathanda ukusisebenzisa?`,n=`Awudingi ukusetha noma yini. Lesi sithombe se-Docker sishumekiwe futhi sakulungisela i-MariaDB ngokuzenzakalelayo. I-Uptime Kuma izoxhuma kule database ngesokhethi le-Unix.`,r=`Xhuma kusizindalwazi sangaphandle se-MariaDB. Udinga ukusetha imininingwane yokuxhumana yesizindalwazi.`,i=`Ifayela lesizindalwazi elilula, elinconyelwe ukuthunyelwa kwezinga elincane. Ngaphambi kwe-v2.0.0, i-Uptime Kuma yasebenzisa i-SQLite njengesizindalwazi esizenzakalelayo.`,a=`Ukusetha isizindalwazi. Kungase kuthathe isikhashana, sicela ubekezele.`,o=`Igama lesizindalwazi`,s=`Nika amandla i-SSL/TLS`,c=`Nika amandla ukusebenzisa uxhumano olubethelwe kusizindalwazi sakho. Iyadingeka kuzigcinilwazi eziningi zamafu.`,l=`Isitifiketi se-CA`,u=`Namathisela I-CA Cert ngefomethi ye-PEM ukuze uyisebenzise nezitifiketi ezizisayinele. Shiya kungenalutho uma isizindalwazi sakho sisebenzisa isitifiketi esisayinwe yi-CA yomphakathi.`,d={languageName:e,setupDatabaseChooseDatabase:t,setupDatabaseEmbeddedMariaDB:n,setupDatabaseMariaDB:r,setupDatabaseSQLite:i,settingUpDatabaseMSG:a,dbName:o,enableSSL:s,mariadbUseSSLHelptext:c,mariadbCaCertificateLabel:l,mariadbCaCertificateHelptext:u};export{o as dbName,d as default,s as enableSSL,e as languageName,u as mariadbCaCertificateHelptext,l as mariadbCaCertificateLabel,c as mariadbUseSSLHelptext,a as settingUpDatabaseMSG,t as setupDatabaseChooseDatabase,n as setupDatabaseEmbeddedMariaDB,r as setupDatabaseMariaDB,i as setupDatabaseSQLite};